<!--restStopElse-->
[
_line["A majority of the time, it'd be either Nurandah citizens traveling to Yavana or Yavanids wanting to visit the empire. Anyone sailing the Nurrah Sea, basically. Most are merchants, but many are adventurers as well. Scholars, mercenaries, treasure hunters, thrill-seekers - you know the sort."
<br>
"Quite a few of these adventurers do intend to stop at Askava - usually because they're headed to the Navveh ruins inland, or they're looking to be employed by the pilgrims or even the army. In other words, they're all headed inland, only stopping by at Apesai to stock up."]
<br>
The Reclamation is proving to be quite lucrative for those who had a initiative for it, and the city of Apesai is in the perfect position to collect the dues.
<br>
